    Comparison: the twee check of the laws that the fuel changes at HugeLists 7-p4
    
    Twee 2.7.1, with 180 seconds for each goal, proves 147 of the 578 laws that
    only the run without the fuel prints, and 31 of the 45 laws that only the
    run with the fuel prints, from the laws of the other run. It shows none of
    them independent.

